{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别急，我刚才还担心自己会卡壳，结果这局突然变慢了，我差点就忘了怎么呼吸。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.955, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 93, "total_tokens": 127, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "够不够？我这就去拿你的零花钱。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.302, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 144, "total_tokens": 178, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哎呀，那两音差点就唱破了，我差点就哭出声了。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.734, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 25, "prompt_tokens": 91, "total_tokens": 116, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}, {"spoken_text": "别怕，下一首我特意把开头调得特别轻，怕你听不清楚。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.323, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 135, "total_tokens": 177, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，那把木勺我留着，玻璃杯给你，阿栀。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.183, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 89, "total_tokens": 134, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "我拿木勺敲两下，拍子就响起来。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.272, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 136, "total_tokens": 173, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜台我管，我负责把云寄的包裹送到家。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.031, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 94, "total_tokens": 136, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}, {"spoken_text": "先帮它装好，再把它寄过去。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.251, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 137, "total_tokens": 171, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哎呀，那路太窄了，我差点没刹住。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.653, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 22, "prompt_tokens": 94, "total_tokens": 116, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 65}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就去，等会儿再给你看。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.323, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 132, "total_tokens": 175, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "老板今天又加班，我这就去把工位上的零食都塞满。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.785, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 26, "prompt_tokens": 96, "total_tokens": 122, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "老板今天又加班，我这就去把工位上的零食都塞满。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.655, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 135, "total_tokens": 183, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁也没注意。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.517, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 14, "prompt_tokens": 91, "total_tokens": 105, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "给这个扣子取个小名。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.888, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 27, "prompt_tokens": 123, "total_tokens": 150, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别急，我这就给你讲个笑话，你听好了。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.075, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 90, "total_tokens": 125, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "哼，谁让那把椅子太舒服，连呼吸都懒得动。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.784, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 28, "prompt_tokens": 131, "total_tokens": 159, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
